    {
      "fileName": "malleable-form.json",
      "id": "okJjCvQ6hcCk8FOC",
      "name": "Malleable Form",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "okJjCvQ6hcCk8FOC",
        "folder": "XAieOWIiehiOR1pF",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Malleable Form",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're polymorphed by a spell that has multiple choices of battle form.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You adroitly shift your form, taking on another appearance. Choose a different battle form of the polymorph spell affecting you, and change to that form instead of the current one. This destabilizes the spell's magic, reducing its duration by 1 round. Use the rank of the spell to determine the statistics, as normal.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 13
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "ability to cast at least one polymorph spell"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Dark Archive (Remastered)"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "reflection"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 13,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "mirror-refuge.json",
      "id": "Nb8iLgQeuHU73hQM",
      "name": "Mirror Refuge",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "Nb8iLgQeuHU73hQM",
        "folder": "XAieOWIiehiOR1pF",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Mirror Refuge",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're within 5 feet of a mirrored surface.</p><hr /><p>Your origin in the space behind mirrors enables you to use a mirror as a hideaway, like the spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.One with Stone]. You meld into an adjacent mirror. You can hear but not see outside this space, and creatures outside can't see or hear you. You can cast spells while within the mirror, but no effects can cross the mirror. Your Mirror Refuge lasts for 10 minutes unless the mirror is broken, which expels you and deals @Damage[10d6] damage to you. You can Dismiss the effect. You appear in a space adjacent to the mirror when the effect ends.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 9
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Mirror-Risen"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
