      "name": "Redirect Attention",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "TGDy2R6Dq8hwZir4",
        "folder": "XAieOWIiehiOR1pF",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Redirect Attention",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Through your strong connection with your progenitor, you're able to redirect those attempting to spy on you. Whenever you would be directly targeted with a scrying effect, the effect must attempt a counteract check against the higher of your spell DC or class DC. If the check fails, the effect targets your progenitor instead of you.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 13
