          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You hit a creature with a melee Strike on your last action.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You channel some of your own nature through your blow, temporarily warping your target's form to resemble your own. The creature you hit must attempt a @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell] save against the higher of your class DC or spell DC.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target resists the effect but its form twists in the process. It's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target's body briefly warps to resemble yours. It's clumsy 1 until the end of its next turn and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target's body warps to resemble yours for a significant time. It's clumsy 1 for 1 minute and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2}.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "PT1M"
